        "date": "2026-11-26T11:34:15Z"
      },
      "message": "Recover private runtime integer vector constructions in Tier 1\n\nTrack complete integer lanes and constant bytes for nonescaping construction slots, then emit existing narrow lane and balanced width operations at supported AVX-512 output targets. Cover default and inline C paths with byte/effect oracles, strict selection reports and assembly checks.\n\nSigned-off-by: David Gonzalez Martin <davidgmbb@gmail.com>",
