      "message": "Size construction call metadata by instruction count\n\nValid IR may share one call descriptor among several instructions. Count the calls that the construction remapper emits and cover three shared-descriptor calls, their ordered effects, live constants, and original/reconstructed/promoted byte results.\n\nCo-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>\nSigned-off-by: David Gonzalez Martin <davidgmbb@gmail.com>",
